  <description>
    <p>Karten is a simple map for the Plasma desktop. Search for a place, and plan a route there by car, by bicycle or on foot.</p>
    <p>Download a region to keep planning routes and finding places without an internet connection. Map data comes from OpenStreetMap.</p>
  </description>
